{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52462","headline":"五言过楼岩寺 · 高宗皇帝李治","name":"五言过楼岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旋騼登雪岭，飞斾驻香城。\n路盘高下骑，峰廻出没旌。\n云衣缝涧户，霞绮织山楹。\n扬刹移虹影，携风引梵声。\n岫馥鑪烟合，岩悬叠溜萦。\n空结笼檐网，虚谷响台铃。\n簇野千丛暗，长河一带明。\n散望禅林外，方弘拯溺情。\n（见清胡聘之纂《山右石刻丛编》卷五。\n参北京图书馆藏石刻拓本。\n）（按：诗末原署「咸亨三年十一月八日」。\n爲武后时所刻。\n胡聘之谓刻石在蒲州府东南十五里，「河东县文林郎韩怀信书」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高宗皇帝李治","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}